==In the manga==
===Pokémon Pocket Monsters===
In the [[Pokémon Pocket Monsters]] manga, a similar attraction to Pokémon Land known as the Amusement Park was built by {{PPM|Giovanni}}. {{PPM|Red}}, {{TP|Red|Clefairy}}, and {{PPM|Red's Pikachu|Pikachu}} visited the Amusement Park. Giovanni was not happy to see them in the place he built. He sent out {{p|Machamp}} and {{p|Poliwhirl}}, which evolved into {{p|Poliwrath}}, to take care of them. Like most places that Clefairy visits, this one ends up being destroyed in the end by Clefairy himself.

